      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Cái này bao nhiêu? is the pointing phrase for one visible thing: a mango, shirt, coffee, seafood tray, menu photo, or ride add-on. The phrase is small, but it protects the moment before money gets awkward.",
