    {
      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "The useful part is timing. Ask before the bag is packed, the plate is weighed, or the ride has started, then repeat or show the number back so both sides see the same price.",
      "presentation": "plain-text",
      "phrases": [],
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
      "id": "traveler-insight",
      "title": "Traveler insight",
      "body": "The answer may be spoken fast, typed into a phone, shown on a calculator, or answered with a gesture. If the number matters, ask them to type it.",
